{
  "id": "error_system",
  "name": "Error System",
  "category": "utility",
  "description": "Structured error models, rule-based mapping, app/screen error channels and the matching UI surfaces.",
  "tier": "component",
  "install": "flutter_shadcn add error_system",
  "import": "import 'package:<your_app>/ui/shadcn/error_system/error_system.dart';",
  "tags": ["utility", "error", "handling", "repository", "ui"],
  "deps": {
    "foundation": ["gap", "icons"],
    "theme": ["color_tokens", "theme"],
    "primitives": ["error_handling"],
    "components": ["alert_dialog", "button", "card", "divider", "toast"]
  },
  "files": [
    "error_system.dart",
    "error_system_style.dart",
    "error_system_theme.dart",
    "preview.dart"
  ],
  "api": {
    "classes": [
      "AppError",
      "ErrorAction",
      "ErrorRule",
      "RuleBasedErrorMapper",
      "ErrorRegistry",
      "ErrorHandledRepository",
      "RetryStrategy",
      "AppErrorHub",
      "HubAppScope",
      "HubScreenScope",
      "ScreenErrorScope",
      "ErrorSystemTheme",
      "ErrorState",
      "InlineError",
      "AppErrorBanner",
      "AppErrorGate",
      "ErrorSlot"
    ],
    "enums": ["AppErrorCode", "ErrorActionType", "ErrorScopeType"],
    "typedefs": ["ErrorMatch", "ErrorBuild"],
    "functions": [
      "rule",
      "guard",
      "guardSync",
      "apiRules",
      "authRules",
      "validationRules",
      "platformRules",
      "networkRules",
      "fingerprintFor",
      "fallbackRule",
      "showErrorDialog",
      "showErrorSnackbar",
      "errorActionButton"
    ],
    "constants": ["errorSystemDefaults", "errorSystemThemeOverrides"]
  },
  "theme": {
    "class": "ErrorSystemTheme",
    "userFile": "error_system_theme.dart",
    "defaults": "errorSystemDefaults",
    "fields": {
      "iconColor": "ThemedColor? - destructive token",
      "iconSize": "double? - 36",
      "titleStyle": "TextStyle? - 16/w600; colour falls back to foreground",
      "messageStyle": "TextStyle? - 14; colour falls back to mutedForeground",
      "cardPadding": "EdgeInsetsGeometry? - 24",
      "bannerBackground": "ThemedColor? - card token",
      "bannerBorder": "ThemedColor? - destructive token",
      "bannerPadding": "EdgeInsetsGeometry? - 16/12"
    }
  },
  "notes": [
    "The non-visual machinery lives in `primitives/error_handling/` (models, rules/matching, registry, repository, retry backoff, scopes, recovery) and is re-exported by `error_system.dart`.",
    "`components/error_system/` keeps only the visual widgets, the theme and the style.",
    "`showErrorSnackbar` uses the `toast` component's `showToast` (the old code inserted raw `OverlayEntry`s and kept a static entry list).",
    "`ErrorSnackbar`'s static entry list and the old `ErrorDialog.show` / `ErrorSnackbar.show` statics are gone (clean break); use `showErrorDialog` / `showErrorSnackbar`."
  ]
}
